o some degree by insurance. But even insured patients can still face bills =
that bankrupt them. Then you have the more experimental treatments that are=
 not yet approved and harder to come by.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal =
17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>A new pancreatic =
cancer drug, for example, which targets a mutation common in many cancers, =
is now covered in the U.S., though the supply chain is </span><a href=3D"ht=
