e=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span =
style=3D"font-weight:700">What about elsewhere in the world=3F</span></p><p=
 style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><=
span>Globally, it varies. Targeted lung cancer therapies are more accessibl=
