mpanies themselves decide which countries to seek drug approval from, and t=
hey often don=E2=80=99t apply in countries where they think they won=E2=80=
=99t make a lot of money.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georg=
ia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span style=3D"font-weight:700">You=E2=
=80=99ve written about some of the unexpected repercussions of people being=
 diagnosed with cancer now </span><a href=3D"https://nl.nytimes.com/f/newsl=
etter/w9VGz1PLHjxLmoTk0J7MFg~~/AAAAARA~/1VyfoeKWjt4tOfTf2t_gAybi8HZizPoTTAi=
